class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 the middle sat at 29% of normal for March to April, then 144% for April to May. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 37% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2000, and grids 10395 and 10396 got down to 60%.</p>"}
